<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Withdrawal completed</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 24px; background: #f6f7fb; color: #263238; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; }
      h1 { color: #218838; font-size: 24px; }
      p { line-height: 1.6; }
      .details { margin: 24px 0; padding: 16px; background: #f2faf4; border-radius: 8px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 32px; color: #687780; font-size: 13px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <h1>Withdrawal completed successfully</h1>
      <p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
      <p>Your withdrawal has been marked successful by the payout provider.</p>
      <section class="details">
        <p><strong>Amount:</strong> ₹{{amount}}</p>
        <p><strong>Withdrawal ID:</strong> {{withdrawalId}}</p>
        <p><strong>Bank reference (UTR):</strong> {{utr}}</p>
      </section>
      <p>If the funds are not visible in your bank account yet, please allow your bank time to update the balance.</p>
      <p class="footer">Thank you for choosing Hydacon.<br />Hydacon Support Team</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
